 "nct_id": "NCT01499095",
 "brief_title": "Comparison of a New Formulation of Insulin Glargine With Lantus in Patients With Type 2 Diabetes on Basal Insulin With Oral Antidiabetic Therapy",
 "official_title": "6-Month, Multicenter, Randomized, Open-label, Parallel-group Study Comparing the Efficacy and Safety of a New Formulation of Insulin Glargine and Lantus® Both in Combination With Oral Antihyperglycemic Drug(s) in Patients With Type 2 Diabetes Mellitus With a 6-month Safety Extension Period",
